            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.2174/1874210601509010197</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Dentists encounter a wide range of hard-tissue injuries in practice. Dental extractions are one of the most common procedures in dentistry and may lead to several complications, including oral sinus complications, osteitis, infection, dysesthesia, pain, and bleeding.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
